OL,3,AIsraeli strike on Nasser Hospital kills
OL,4,Aat least six, Gaza civil defence agency
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least six people have been killed
OL,8,Fafter an Israeli airstrike hit a
OL,9,Fbuilding at Nasser Hospital in southern
OL,10,FGaza, an official from the Hamas-run
OL,11,Fcivil defence agency has said.
OL,13,FThe strike hit the surgery department
OL,14,Fof the hospital in Khan Younis,
OL,15,Fwounding at least 20 people and causing
OL,16,Fextensive damage, spokesperson Mahmoud
OL,17,FBasal told news agency AFP.
OL,19,FA surgeon is reported to be among those
OL,20,Fwho were killed during the strike early
OL,21,Fon Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
