OL,3,AIsraeli strike on Nasser Hospital kills
OL,4,Aat least six, Gaza civil defence agency
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere has been no immediate response
OL,8,Ffrom the Israeli military. The BBC has
OL,9,Fcontacted the Israel Defense Forces for
OL,10,Fcomment.
